[h3]Hello Climbers,
        Our journey began and after the first month, we experienced some issues and huge feedback from all of you - thanks for that!

[b]Now you can enjoy Climber: Sky is the Limit in two new languages!:[/b]
[b]Turkish[/b] - done by [b]Burak AY[/b]
[b]Italian[/b] - done by [b]Roberto Cassani[/b]  aka Roby
Thanks a lot for your help guys!

So we have prepared a patch to boost the gameplay based on all the feedback delivered on Steam discussions, reviews, and our discord.[/h3]

[b]Here are the changes:
[list]
Manaslu
[*] rock models improved next to checkpoints 1&2;

Cho Oyu
[*] textures improved;
[*] snow covered the collapsed mountain;
[*] horizontal view on the top;

Mount Everest
[*] textures improved next to the tunnel;
[*] battery level informaiton;
[*] player glitching issues on the hiking part mountain;
[*] player respawns after the crevassee failed without a ladder;

K2
[*] fixed cutting the corner before the camp on the icy mountain;
[*] corrected the color of the route dots next to the base camp;
[*] player blocks on the hiking part mountain;
[/list][/b]

If you have any issues feel free to send us game log files so we could investigate the problem:
C:\Users\{YOUR_USER_NAME}\AppData\LocalLow\A2Softworks\Climber Sky is the Limit"
to support@art-games.com

If you would like to localize Climber to your language just let us know!
[b]Stay tuned for the next updates.[/b]

