[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36776987/29e1bcfd49fbee2720bd17d174d2b469d528b945.jpg[/img]
[h3]Hello Climbers!
      First of all, thank you for your patience after Free Trial was published some time ago.
We have noted the most important feedback from all of you and made some improvements to our game.[/h3]

In our opinion game needs challenging features and many PLAYERS pointed that out. 
So we took a deep breath, analyzed the pros and cons, and decided to deliver this feature in a leaderboard form. 
Now each player can compare his/her mountain score with other players globally. 
On top of that, you can push the summit with or without an oxygen mask and bottle. So you can adjust the difficulty of each summit push!

Currently, we are testing those features, mechanics, and fixed bugs internally and with some of your help through players' beta testing - [b]Big thanks to our [url=https://discord.gg/327t8Zkv]Discord [/url]community <3.[/b]
Please remember that this is still a work in progress and more features are scheduled to be implemented.

[h3]Now after this short introduction we would like to share with you what has been done:[/h3]

[b]New mechanics:[/b]
- TOP50 leaderboards with all players' records per each mountain;
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36776987/7e0f770d2b6096bbee3cc2615b99827ddb738e96.jpg[/img]

- oxygen mask and bottle (on/off animation, bottle switching animation, a new item in inventory and shop, icons on HUD);
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36776987/8c0cbe0c5a8f3dcca92673f10b32a7b8f24697e3.jpg[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36776987/ae47ac7cd59539d695cffecc22ae4baba262c5ca.gif[/img]

- victory scene after pushing the summit;
- checkpoints despite taking different routes;

[b]Visual effects:[/b]
- actual players dead zones area highlighted on each mountain based on the number of times players failed;
- buffed in-game wind effects;
- option to hide HUD;

[b]Bugs:[/b]
- scrolling the grid while moving an item before expedition;
- changed the sound name effect in settings;
- fixed the meters vs feet altitude information;
- Japanese localization improved;
- fixed choosing the mountain in the menu;
- Other small fixes reported by you


Please keep an ear to the ground as more news is coming.
If you would like to test the new Climber build feel free to join our Discord and talk to us!

[b]P.S. Free Trial update coming soon...[/b]

